.SH BUGS
The jack has carried real calls between the author's desktop and a site node; routes, everything through the line, a laptop moving between networks, a real systemd\-resolved and real wide\-area links have not been tried.
Sharing a machine's internet is tested on the engine and on the real kernel in network namespaces; a real tap under a real node end to end, and a real exit on the internet, have not been tried.
The graphical items have been tested against stubs and the desktop's own code, and are used on the author's desktop.
Choosing the attach mode automatically *(planned: M4)*.
